  dialogueLines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f08b62598cfd73d4f88944f17a08c3b7, type: 2}
    line: 哇啊啊啊——！！
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0bc5327fda19cdc46b15353e7e4ed256, type: 2}
    line: 哇啊啊啊——！！
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f08b62598cfd73d4f88944f17a08c3b7, type: 2}
    line: 等等，你为什么也在叫？！
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0bc5327fda19cdc46b15353e7e4ed256, type: 2}
    line: 因为、因为传送的时候很吓人嘛！呜呜呜...到了到了...
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f08b62598cfd73d4f88944f17a08c3b7, type: 2}
    line: 这里就是异世界？看起来...就是一片普通的草地啊。
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0bc5327fda19cdc46b15353e7e4ed256, type: 2}
    line: 嗯~这就是绿丘之地！一个和平的小村庄。好了，我们先去冒险者公会报到吧！
  dialogueOptions:
  - optionText: 出发吧
    nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
